# Core plugin registry, parsed by modules/plugins.zsh (one spec per line).
# owner/repo entries load via `zinit light`; OMZP::/OMZL:: entries via
# `zinit snippet`. Both load synchronously (no turbo wait) while the plugins
# module runs BEFORE completion.zsh, so zsh-completions' fpath additions land
# before compinit and its completions actually register. Blank lines and
# comments are ignored. Plugins only load when ZSH_ENABLE_PLUGINS=1 (off by
# default).
#
# Ordering matters: fast-syntax-highlighting must stay LAST so it wraps the
# widgets created by autosuggestions and history-substring-search.
#
# fzf-tab is NOT loaded from this registry: it must load AFTER compinit, so
# local.zsh sources it directly (gated on the same ZSH_ENABLE_PLUGINS
# toggle). Install it once on any machine:
#   zinit light Aloxaf/fzf-tab
zsh-users/zsh-autosuggestions
zsh-users/zsh-completions
zsh-users/zsh-history-substring-search
zdharma-continuum/fast-syntax-highlighting
OMZP::extract
